Package: nitrateApp
Title: Explore Nitrate Concentrations for three NEON sites (June 2019 - July 2019)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Malaika", "Fernandes", "mfer0073@student.monash.edu", role = c("Author", "Maintainer"))
Description: `nitrateApp` is a package that can be used to explore **daily nitrate concentrations** for three NEON river sites from June 2019 to July 2019. This package can be used as an exploratory tool to access the cleaned dataset of nitrate concentrations, and a *Shiny* app to visutalise patterns over time and location. 
